śvo-bhāva, m. occurrence on the 🞄morrow (śvas);
 -bhāvin, a. occurring on the 🞄morrow;
 -bhūta, pp. id.: lc. at to-morrowʼs 🞄dawn;
 -maraṇa, n. dying on the morrow, 🞄thoughts of imminent death;
 -vasīya, n. future 🞄prosperity;
 -vasīyas-a, a. (ī́) bestowing 🞄future welfare;
 -vasyas-á, a. id. (V.);
 -vijay-ín, a. about to conquer on the morrow (V.).

sva‿uttha, a. produced in oneself, innate;
 🞄[] 🞄-utthita, pp. produced in or due to 🞄oneself;
 -upārjita, pp. acquired by oneself.
